2026/Jun/17 06:34:25.504529 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:46 *** Test objectives:                                    ***
2026/Jun/17 06:34:25.504533 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:47 ***  - MS sends continuous access bursts until PHY INFO ***
