2026/Jun/17 06:34:25.504547 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:51 "***  - 9 handover scenarios: FH" & char(0, 0, 33, 148) & "non-FH, TCH/F" & char(0, 0, 33, 148) & "TCH/H    ***"
